      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's entirely a matter of taste. People can already make unlit avatars by abusing \"Standard Lite's\" emission, all this does is add a more optimized alternative.\n\nI can see legitimate uses for an unlit texture shader, it would be a major mistake to not include it just because some might not like it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
